      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re introducing Falcon-ASR, our 1.6 billion parameter speech recognition model for Arabic, with a particular focus on the Emirati dialect.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In our evaluation, Falcon-ASR achieved an average word error rate of 20.92% across six Arabic test sets, compared with the best published result of 23.17% in the leaderboard snapshot we used.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Competitor figures are the published leaderboard averages checked on 30 September 2026.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Falcon-ASR’s average WER is 2.25 percentage points better than the best published result in that snapshot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In our internal Emirati evaluation, Falcon-ASR achieved 22.73% WER and 10.19% CER:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Its WER is 4.07 percentage points below Qwen3-Omni, the next best result.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In our evaluation on the seven public English test sets used by the Hugging Face Open ASR Leaderboard, it achieved a mean WER of 5.74%.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Falcon-ASR builds on our Falcon3-Audio work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The architecture and training approach for Falcon3-Audio are described in Competitive Audio-Language Models with Data-Efficient Single-Stage Training on Public Data .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/tiiuae/falcon-asr",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T13:21:03.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:22.087Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "نقدّم Falcon-ASR ، نموذجنا للتعرف على الكلام العربي بحجم 1.6 مليار معلمة، مع اهتمام خاص باللهجة الإماراتية. طوّرنا النموذج في معهد الابتكار التكنولوجي ( TII ) في أبوظبي، وهو يدعم أيضًا اللغات الإنجليزية والفرنسية والإسبانية والبرتغالية.",
